  "notes": "{溶|と}ける describes something changing from solid to liquid, or dissolving into a liquid.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{溶|と}かす→溶かす：08264_tokasu⟧ (transitive, to melt/dissolve something)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n⟦{溶|と}け→溶く：26556_toku⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates the state of being melted or dissolved: ⟦{氷|こおり}→氷：02753_koori⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{溶|と}け→溶く：26556_toku⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (the ice is melted).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{溶|と}ける: snow melts\n- ⟦{氷|こおり}→氷：02753_koori⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{溶|と}ける: ice melts\n- ⟦{砂糖|さとう}→砂糖：00884_satou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{溶|と}ける: sugar dissolves\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{溶|と}ける: heart melts (figurative)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {溶|と}ける: to melt or dissolve\n- ⟦{解|と}ける→解ける：04371_tokeru⟧: to come undone, loosen, be solved",
